## 🌐  About Anon Shield

**Anon Shield** is a lightweight, modern Android network client designed to provide users with simple and powerful control over their network traffic.

Built with performance, security and simplicity in mind, Anon Shield brings a clean VPN experience to Android devices.

---

## 🚀  Version 1.0.0

**Anon Shield Android v1.0.0** is the first Android release of the Anon Shield client.

### ✨ Highlights

* ⚡ Fast and optimized connections
* 🔐 Secure proxy tunneling
* 🌐 Multi-protocol support
* 🎯 Smart traffic routing
* 📱 Android-optimized interface
* 🔄 Easy configuration management
* 🛡️ System-wide VPN mode
* 🔋 Lightweight background service
* 🚀 Performance-focused architecture

---

## 🔌  Supported Protocols

| Protocol | Support |
| -------- | :-----: |
| VLESS    |    ✅    |
| VMess    |    ✅    |
| Trojan   |    ✅    |
| Xray     |    ✅    |

---

## 📱  Android Compatibility

| Requirement     | Version              |
| --------------- | -------------------- |
| Minimum Android | Android 7.0 (API 24) |
| Recommended     | Android 10+          |
| Architecture    | ARM64 / ARMv7        |
| Mode            | System-wide VPN      |

---

## 🛠️  Core Technology

Anon Shield is built around modern proxy and tunneling technology with **Xray Core** integration.

### Architecture

```text
┌─────────────────────────────┐
│       ANON SHIELD APP       │
├─────────────────────────────┤
│     Android UI / Client     │
├─────────────────────────────┤
│    Configuration Manager    │
├─────────────────────────────┤
│      VPN / Tunnel Layer     │
├─────────────────────────────┤
│          XRAY CORE          │
├─────────────────────────────┤
│      Secure Connection      │
└─────────────────────────────┘
```

---

## 📥  Installation

1. Download the latest APK from **Releases**.
2. Install the APK on your Android device.
3. Open **Anon Shield**.
4. Import or add your configuration.
5. Start the connection.
6. Allow the Android VPN permission when requested.

---

## 🔗  Configuration

Anon Shield supports adding and managing connection configurations.

Configurations can be added through supported import/share methods depending on the release.

> ⚠️ Only use configurations and servers that you trust.

---

## 🔒  Privacy & Security

Anon Shield is designed to provide a secure and private networking experience.

The actual privacy and security of a connection also depends on the server, configuration and network being used.

Anon Shield does not guarantee anonymity or security against every threat.

---

## ⚠️  Disclaimer

Anon Shield is a network connectivity and privacy tool.

Users are responsible for complying with applicable laws, regulations, network policies and service terms when using the application.

---

